    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "John I. Kennedy International Airport\n4. a.\nNew York City",
      "Dester\nMANHATTAN\nC-95\nSOVEREIGN\nJohn F Kennedy\nInternational Airport\nAirport serves\nThis International Airport, opened in 1948, serves more than 12\nmillion passengers a year. Truly an aerial\ngateway to the United\nStates, it is a city in itself with its own bank, newspaper and\nhotel.\nPhoto by A.J. Cameron\nDR-34636-D\nManhattan Post Card Pub. Co.,\nInc.,\n418 Lafayette St., N.Y.C., N.Y. 10003\nMADE BY\ndp DENTER PRESS\nWEST NYACK, NEW YORK\n2015.166.2139"
    ],
